  "description": "The Ridley E-Noah is the first electric version of Ridley’s iconic aero road bike, combining top performance with subtle electric assistance. Thanks to the ultra-compact TQ HPR40 system, the bike remains exceptionally light (under 11 kg) while preserving its aerodynamic shape. The motor and battery are fully integrated, making the E-Noah hardly distinguishable from a traditional road bike. With 40 Nm of torque and 200 W of additional power, it delivers a natural, powerful ride feel that can be personalized via the TQ app. Aimed at sporty riders who want to go farther and longer without losing the authentic racing sensation, the E-Noah sets a new standard for aero e-performance.",
